id":925992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/921517-what-do-you-want-from-warstriders-in-3ed?p=925789#post925789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bThat's a bit of an awkward translation to a game with superhuman Brawlers, isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, it's not like the main characters aren't superhuman brawlers. They can still do <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yL-_0Yo4ZMQ\" target=\"_blank\">incredible</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nptFYk0jxcc\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ObpU2GjmRw\" target=\"_blank\">wuxia</a> stuff.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/921517-what-do-you-want-from-warstriders-in-3ed?p=925789#post925789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bWhat kinds of things are those?</div> </div> </div> </div>The biggest things that Gears are used for are: fighting giant monsters, fighting other Gears, and destroying cities. I think the best way that the game puts it into perspective is with the first major boss battle. Fei, the main character, finds himself face to face with a Rankar Dragon (a Tyrant Lizard by any other name). He puts up a valiant fight, punching and kicking it in the face, to no avail. Then, the cavalry arrives! Citan, Fei's technically-minded friend, arrives atop a whirligig machine carrying Fei's Gear. Fei hops into the gear and duels the Dragon from an even playing field. You can watch the scene <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3b1JWwIUMvQ\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11619-kymmetheseventh","name":"KymmetheSeventh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-04T12:57:32-07:00","id":926040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KymmetheSeventh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/921517-what-do-you-want-from-warstriders-in-3ed?p=925625#post925625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd like to be able to reenact Xenogears. That game is pretty well defined by its use of mecha and though there are hand-to-hand battles between characters, they don't really mix with the mecha fights. If Warstriders in Exalted can do the things that Gears can do in Xenogears, I'll be satisfied.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, and apparently appreciate, Xenogears.<br /> Marry me.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KymmetheSeventh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/921517-what-do-you-want-from-warstriders-in-3ed?p=925992#post925992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, it's not like the main characters aren't superhuman brawlers. They can still do <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yL-_0Yo4ZMQ\" target=\"_blank\">incredible</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nptFYk0jxcc\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ObpU2GjmRw\" target=\"_blank\">wuxia</a> stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>In fact, when the player characters are significantly leveled, gears that aren't similarly powered up get thrashed in hand-to-robot combat.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":32,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","user":"Synapse","date":". 07-04-2016, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-04T14:41:36-07:00","id":926093,"title":"","content":"Warstriders should be exceedingly rare. Not something that's fielded in a unit, and definitely not something that is standardized in the rules. I very much consider them N/A artifacts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12072-thefool","name":"TheFool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12072_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-04T16:27:01-07:00","id":926141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KymmetheSeventh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/921517-what-do-you-want-from-warstriders-in-3ed?p=925992#post925992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fei, the main character, finds himself face to face with a Rankar Dragon (a Tyrant Lizard by any other name). He puts up a valiant fight, punching and kicking it in the face, to no avail. Then, the cavalry arrives! Citan, Fei's technically-minded friend, arrives atop a whirligig machine carrying Fei's Gear. Fei hops into the gear and duels the Dragon from an even playing field.</div> </div> </div> </div>If one wants the concept to translate so directly, I think the question then becomes what would a Solar fight that would require a warstrider for an even playing field? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KymmetheSeventh</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> You can watch the scene <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3b1JWwIUMvQ\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div> Why does he say &quot;darn&quot; on one occasion, but &quot;damn&quot; on the next...<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-05T12:17:26-07:00","id":926553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/921517-what-do-you-want-from-warstriders-in-3ed?p=926141#post926141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why does he say &quot;darn&quot; on one occasion, but &quot;damn&quot; on the next...</div> </div> </div> </div>My suspicion is that would have been a side effect of Square's not fantastic translation teams during that generation of games.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, K